{"slug":"652553-chandrana-thumbaa-iruve","title":"ಚಂದ್ರನ  ತುಂಬಾ ಇರುವೆ","titleEn":"Chandrana Thumbaa Iruve","level":"2","description":"","orientation":"landscape","cover":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/652553-chandrana-thumbaa-iruve/cover.jpg","width":548,"height":544},"audio":null,"provenance":{"source":"https://storyweaver.org.in/en/stories/652553-chandrana-thumbaa-iruve","license":"CC-BY-4.0","licenseNote":"Fetched from StoryWeaver's public API; the book's own attribution page states 'Released under CC BY 4.0 license' for the story and each illustration. Text is the page HTML with markup removed; illustrations are StoryWeaver's 700–960 px crops, unmodified apart from JPEG re-encoding; audio re-encoded to mono MP3.","storyweaverId":652553,"authors":["Aparna  Kapur"],"illustrators":["Priya Kuriyan"],"translators":["Cp Ravikumar"],"publisher":"Pratham Books","publishedYear":"2025","originalStory":{"title":"A Moon Full of Ants"},"copyrightNotice":"‘Chandrana Thumbaa Iruve' has been published on StoryWeaver by Pratham Books. www.prathambooks.org.","attributionLine":"ಚಂದ್ರನ  ತುಂಬಾ ಇರುವೆ (Kannada), translated by Cp Ravikumar, based on original story A Moon Full of Ants, written by Aparna  Kapur, illustrated by Priya Kuriyan, published by Pratham Books (© Pratham Books, 2025) under a CC BY 4.0 license on StoryWeaver. Read, create and translate stories for free on www.storyweaver.org.in","imageCredits":[{"page":2,"title":"A girl bursts a cloud to make a lake","illustrator":"Priya Kuriyan","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2024"},{"page":3,"title":"A lake with seven shoes following a girl","illustrator":"Priya Kuriyan","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2024"},{"page":4,"title":"A girl swimming with a giant bowl filled with ice cream","illustrator":"Priya Kuriyan","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2024"},{"page":5,"title":"Crows helping a girl fly to the moon from a race track","illustrator":"Priya Kuriyan","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2024"},{"page":6,"title":"Animals, birds and people dancing in a disco","illustrator":"Priya Kuriyan","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2025"},{"page":7,"title":"Ants on the moon","illustrator":"Priya Kuriyan","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2024"},{"page":8,"title":"Unicorn accountants and a girl","illustrator":"Priya Kuriyan","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2024"},{"page":9,"title":"Girl swimming under water with corals","illustrator":"Priya Kuriyan","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2024"},{"page":10,"title":"Girl sailing on a banana boat as the sun shines on","illustrator":"Priya Kuriyan","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2024"},{"page":11,"title":"A planet full of toads and teapots","illustrator":"Priya Kuriyan","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2024"},{"page":12,"title":"Toads jumping and dancing happily","illustrator":"Priya Kuriyan","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2024"}],"retrieved":"2026-09-25"},"pages":[{"n":1,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/652553-chandrana-thumbaa-iruve/p01.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["ನಾನು ಕಣ್ಣು ತೆರೆದೆ; ಮೈ ಮುರಿದೆ","ಮೋಡಕ್ಕೆ ತಗುಲಿ ಬೆರಳು ಆಯಿತು ಒದ್ದೆ","ಕೈ ಒರೆಸಿ ಹೊಲಕ್ಕೆ, ಎದ್ದೆ ಮೇಲಕ್ಕೆ","ನಾನು ಪಾದ ಊರಿದ ಕಡೆಗೆ","ಹುಟ್ಟಿಕೊಂಡಿತೇ ದೊಡ್ಡ ಸರೋವರ."]},{"n":2,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/652553-chandrana-thumbaa-iruve/p02.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["ಸರೋವರ ಏನಂದುಕೊಂಡಿತು ಗೊತ್ತಾ?","ಅದು ನನ್ನ ಮಗು ಅಂತ!","ಹಿಂದೇನೇ ಬಂತು ಹಾಕ್ಕೊಂಡು ಏಳು ಬೂಟು.","ಎಷ್ಟು ಸದ್ದು ಖಟ್ ಪಟ್ ಅಂತ! ರಾದ್ಧಾಂತ!"]},{"n":3,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/652553-chandrana-thumbaa-iruve/p03.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["ಯಾರೋ ಮಹಾಶಯ ಮಾಡಿದ ಕರೆ:","“ಇವತ್ತು ಮಧ್ಯಾಹ್ನದ ಊಟಕ್ಕೆ ಏನು ಮಾರಾಯರೆ?”","“ಇನ್ನೇನು? ಮೂವತ್ತೇಳು ಸೌಟು ಐಸ್ ಕ್ರೀಮ್ ಮತ್ತು","ಒಂದು ಬಟ್ಟಲು ಶಿಶಿರ, ಗರಿಗರಿ ಗಮ್ಮತ್ತು.”"]},{"n":4,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/652553-chandrana-thumbaa-iruve/p04.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["ನಾನು ರೂಪ ಬದಲಿಸಿಕೊಂಡು…","ಒಂದು ಕಾಗೆಯಾಗಿ ಮಾರ್ಪಟ್ಟೆ ಮತ್ತು","ಒಂದು ಗದ್ದಲದ ಪಂದ್ಯದಲ್ಲಿ ಗೆದ್ದುಬಿಟ್ಟೆ","ನನ್ನ ಅಪ್ಪ ಎಷ್ಟು ಹೆಮ್ಮೆ ಪಟ್ಟ ಗೊತ್ತಾ?","ಕಾಣಿಸಿತಲ್ಲಿ ನನಗೆ ಅವನ ಇನ್ನೊಂದು ಮುಖ.","ಚಂದ್ರನ ಮೇಲೆ ವಾಸ ಮಾಡುವ ಮೊಲ","ನೀವೂ ನೋಡಿದ್ದೀರಾ ಅಲ್ವ?","ನೀನೇ ನನ್ನ ಪರಮಮಿತ್ರ ಅಂತ ನೀಡಿತು ಆಹ್ವಾನ:","ಬಾ ಒಟ್ಟಿಗೇ ಡಾನ್ಸ್ ಮಾಡೋಣ…"]},{"n":5,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/652553-chandrana-thumbaa-iruve/p05.jpg","width":708,"height":507},"text":["ಅದೂ ಯಾವ ನೃತ್ಯ - ರಿಂಗ್ ಡಿಂಗ್ ಡಿಸ್ಕೋ!"]},{"n":6,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/652553-chandrana-thumbaa-iruve/p06.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["ನಾ ಹೋಗಲ್ಲಪ್ಪ.","ಯಾಕೆ ಗೊತ್ತಾ,","ಚಂದ್ರನ ಮೇಲಿದೆಯಂತೆ","ವಿಪರೀತ ಇರುವೆ ಕಾಟ.","ಇದನ್ನು ನನಗೆ ಹೇಳಿದ್ದು","ಯಾರಪ್ಪಾ ಅಂದರೆ","ನನ್ನ ಹಲ್ಲಿನಲ್ಲಿರುವ","ಒಂಟಿಕೊಂಬಿನ ಕುದುರೆ."]},{"n":7,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/652553-chandrana-thumbaa-iruve/p07.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["ಇಂಥವೆಲ್ಲಾ ಗೊತ್ತಿರುತ್ತೆ ಹೇಗೆ","ಒಂಟಿ ಕೊಂಬಿನ ಕುದುರೆಗಳಿಗೆ","ಹೇಗೆಂದರೆ ಒಂದು ಕಾಲದಲ್ಲಿ ಅವು","ಲೆಕ್ಕ ಬರೆಯುವ ಉದ್ಯೋಗದಲ್ಲಿದ್ದವಂತೆ."]},{"n":8,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/652553-chandrana-thumbaa-iruve/p08.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["ಬದಲಿಗೆ ನಾನು ಹೋದೆ ಬೇರೊಂದು ಕಡೆ","ಕಡಲಿನ ನಡುವಿರುವ ಉದ್ಯಾನವನಕ್ಕೆ","ನನ್ನನ್ನು ನೋಡಿ ಖುಷಿಯಾದವು ಹವಳ-","ನಾನಿಲ್ಲದೆ ಪಾಪ ಹೆದರಿದ್ದವು ಬಹಳ."]},{"n":9,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/652553-chandrana-thumbaa-iruve/p09.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["ಚಿನಕುರಳಿ ಜೋಕ್‌ ಹೇಳಿದೆ ಪಟಪಟನೆ-","ಅದು ತಮಾಷೆಯಷ್ಟೇ ಅಲ್ಲ, ನಿಜವಾದ ಘಟನೆ.","ಸೂರ್ಯನಿಗೆ ನಕ್ಕೂ ನಕ್ಕೂ ಕಣ್ಣಲ್ಲಿ ನೀರು.","ಇಳಿಯಿತು ಹಾಗಾಗಿ ಅವನ ಬಿಸಿಲಿನ ಜೋರು."]},{"n":10,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/652553-chandrana-thumbaa-iruve/p10.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["ಸಾಮಾನ್ಯವೇ ಸೂರ್ಯನ ಕಣ್ಣೀರು? ಕೋಡಿ!","ಹರಿದು ಹೊಸ ಗ್ರಹವನ್ನೇ ತೋರಿಸಿತು ನೋಡಿ.","ಅಲ್ಲಿ ವಂಡರಗಪ್ಪೆ, ಚಹಾ ಕುಡಿಕೆಗಳ ಚೌಕಾಬಾರ.","ಮುಳುಗುವುದನ್ನೇ ಮರೆತ ದಿವಸಗಳ ಸರದಾರ!"]},{"n":11,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/652553-chandrana-thumbaa-iruve/p11.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["ಹೀಗಾಗಿ ನಾವಿಲ್ಲಿ ಕಳೆದಿದ್ದೇವೆ ಒಟ್ಟು ದಿವಸ ಪೂರಾ ಮತ್-ತುಂಬ-ತ್ತು."]}],"wordCount":198}